  <History Date="27-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised conditionals.  Moved raw function into else condition.  Fixed duplicate else functions." />
  <History Date="27-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Swapped fixed and index colours (they were the wrong way around).  Fixed congo swatch colour." />
  <History Date="27-10-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed index colour function names.  Added function index.  Increased wheel resolution." />
